  "releaseNotes": "v0.7.2: Fixes Claude Opus 4.7+ extended-thinking requests. The legacy thinking.type=enabled + budget_tokens shape is rejected by Opus 4.7 with \"thinking.type.enabled is not supported for this model\". ClaudeProvider now emits thinking.type=adaptive paired with output_config.effort (low/medium/high derived from the existing ThinkingBudget token count) for Opus 4.7 and newer; older Claude models keep the legacy shape. No public API changes.",
